{"id": "136365", "name": "פתרון מערכת באמצעות כלל קרמר", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "nondistinct", "params": ["p1", "p2", "p3"], "body": "(p1=p2 or p1=p3 or p2=p3)"}, {"name": "decollinearize", "params": ["p1", "p2", "p3"], "body": "block(if (collinear(p1,p2,p3)) then p3[3]: p3[3]+1,if (nondistinct(p1,p2,p3) or collinear(p1,p2,p3)) then p3[2]: p3[2]+1)"}, {"name": "genmat", "params": [], "body": "block([m], m: zeromatrix(n,n)+5 - rand(zeromatrix(n,n)+11),\n  m[1,1]: if(m[1]=m[2]) then m[1,1]+1 else m[1,1],\n  m[3,1]: if nondistinct(m[1],m[2],m[3]) then m[2,1]-1 else m[3,1],\n  m)"}, {"name": "detB", "params": ["i"], "body": "(-1)^(i+1)*determinant(addcol(submatrix(mat,i),solcol))", "array": true}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתבונן במערכת המשוואות:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{{CT:0}}\\cdot{{CT:1}}={{CT:2}}\\]</p><p>שיש לה פתרון יחיד. נסמן ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> את מטריצת המקדמים. בתרגיל זה נמצא את ערך ה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> של הפתרון של המערכת (ערכי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> ו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z\\)</span> ניתן למצוא באופן דומה) באמצעות כלל קרמר.</p><p>נסמן ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_i\\)</span> את המטריצה המתקבלת מהחלפת העמודה ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(i\\)</span> ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> בוקטור העמודה <span dir=\"ltr\">{{CT:3}}</span>. מתקיים:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\det(B_2)={{CT:4}},\\;\\; \\det(B_3)={{CT:5}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(B_1)\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\det(B_1) = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p>ובעזרתו חשבו את ערך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> של הפתרון למערכת המשוואות (מתקיים כי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(A)={{CT:6}}\\)</span>):</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(x= \\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הערה: הדרך להזנת השבר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}}\\)</span> היא <code dir=\"ltr\">a/b</code></p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "det", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "det", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 1, "nodes": [{"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "detB[1]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">צדקת בחישוב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(det(B_1)\\)</span></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback":